{"ticker":"ALGN","updated":"2026-11-06T22:39:02Z","profile":{"longName":"Align Technology, Inc.","shortName":"Align Technology, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","country":"United States","website":"https://www.aligntech.com","fullTimeEmployees":20180,"marketCap":11700851712,"trailingPE":24.19825,"forwardPE":13.48254,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.8136497,"pegRatio":0.73,"targetMeanPrice":186.5,"targetHighPrice":210.0,"targetLowPrice":162.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.019,"earningsGrowth":1.436,"grossMargins":0.71532,"operatingMargins":0.2013,"profitMargins":0.11828,"totalRevenue":4158603008,"beta":1.738,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":200.44,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":130.23,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Align Technology, Inc. provides Invisalign clear aligners, Vivera retainers, and iTero intraoral scanners and services in the United States, Switzerland, and internationally. The company's Clear Aligner segment offers Invisalign comprehensive package to treat adults and teens malocclusion and features, and orthodontic needs of teenage or younger patients; and Invisalign First Phase I and Invisalign First Comprehensive Phase 2 package for younger patients between the ages of six and ten years with a mixture of primary/baby and permanent teeth. This segment also provides Invisalign express, Invisalign lite, and Invisalign moderate; Invisalign Go, Invisalign Go express, and Invisalign Go Plus; retention products, Invisalign training, adjusting tools used by dental professionals during treatment, ancillary Invisalign accessory products, and other oral health products; Invisalign Professional Whitening system; Invisalign Palatal Expander, a 3D printed orthodontic device; and 3D printing solutions. Its Imaging Systems and CAD/CAM Services segment offers iTero intraoral scanning system, a single hardware platform for restorative or orthodontic procedures; exocad, a computer-aided design and computer-aided manufacturing software; orthodontist software for digital records storage, orthodontic diagnosis, and fabrication of printed models and retainers; and restorative software for genera","summary_zh":"Align Technology, Inc. 在美國、瑞士和國際上提供 Invisalign 隱形矯正器、Vivera 固定器和 iTero 口內掃描器及服務。該公司的 Clear Aligner 部門提供 Invisalign 隱適美綜合方案，用於治療成人和青少年的咬合不正和特徵，以及青少年或更年輕患者的正畸需求； Invisalign First 第一階段和 Invisalign First 綜合第二階段套餐適用於 6 至 10 歲的年輕患者，其中包括乳牙/嬰兒牙和恆牙。此細分市場還提供 Invisalign 隱適美 Express、Invisalign lite 和 Invisalign 中度隱適美； Invisalign Go、Invisalign Go express 和 Invisalign Go Plus；固位產品、Invisalign 隱適美培訓、牙科專業人員在治療期間使用的調整工具、輔助性輕拍 Invisalign 專業產品；隱適美腭擴張器，一種 3D 列印的矯正裝置；和 3D 列印解決方案。其成像系統和 CAD/CAM 服務部門提供 iTero 口內掃描系統，這是用於修復或正畸手術的單一硬體平台； exocad，一種電腦輔助設計和電腦輔助製造軟體；用於數位記錄儲存、正畸診斷以及列印模型和保持器製造的正畸醫生軟體；和通用的恢復軟體","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材及用品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":139.88,"h":139.88,"l":136.43,"c":136.86,"v":1423500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":135.82,"h":140.37,"l":135.17,"c":135.93,"v":1762600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":136.23,"h":138.54,"l":132.48,"c":132.94,"v":1518200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":133.0,"h":137.69,"l":132.93,"c":135.91,"v":1774800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":135.52,"h":135.52,"l":131.51,"c":131.56,"v":719500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":132.9,"h":133.72,"l":130.84,"c":131.06,"v":1057500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":131.76,"h":133.23,"l":131.27,"c":131.82,"v":761200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":131.51,"h":134.82,"l":128.52,"c":129.44,"v":1453100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":131.93,"h":132.89,"l":129.32,"c":132.57,"v":1223100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":131.84,"h":132.0,"l":130.1,"c":131.39,"v":2284600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":130.99,"h":131.97,"l":129.38,"c":131.18,"v":796500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":132.4,"h":132.41,"l":128.91,"c":129.0,"v":960700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":128.9,"h":130.29,"l":127.62,"c":128.18,"v":938500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":125.74,"h":126.66,"l":122.0,"c":124.88,"v":1623300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":125.46,"h":127.0,"l":124.55,"c":126.19,"v":908900},